== About

Keyun Cheng received the B.Eng. degree in Software Engineering from
[http://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-Sen University] in 2018, the M.Sc. degree in
Computer Science from [https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ The Chinese University of Hong
Kong] in 2019, and the Ph.D. degree in Computer Science and Engineering from
[https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ The Chinese University of Hong Kong] in 2025.  He
was a member of [http://adslab.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/ Applied Distributed System
Lab] (ADSLab) in The Chinese University of Hong Kong, supervised by
[https://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~pclee Prof. Patrick P. C. Lee].  His research
interests include distributed storage systems and erasure coding.  He
maintains a [https://keyuncheng.github.io/readings reading list].


== Education

- 2020.08 - 2025.07: Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2018.08 - 2019.07: M.Sc. in Computer Science, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2014.08 - 2018.07: B.Eng. in Software Engineering, Sun Yat-Sen University


